uplink-ammo-bundlenew-name = Arms Dealer kit
uplink-ammo-bundlenew-desc = A configurable ammunition supply for the entire squad. Choose five different boxes of suitable ammunition.

sunrise-ammo-kit-selection-smg-description = Contains three SP, two FMJ, and one HP magazine for the C-20r.
sunrise-ammo-kit-selection-rifle-description = Contains three SP, two FMJ, and one AP magazine for the Estoc.
sunrise-ammo-kit-selection-caseless-description = Contains four extended caseless magazines for the Siar-52.
sunrise-ammo-kit-selection-dragunov-description = Contains two SP and two extended magazines for the Dragunov.
sunrise-ammo-kit-selection-antimaterial-description = Contains two magazines of each available ammunition type for the Bauer-127.
sunrise-ammo-kit-selection-shotgun-description = Contains five buckshot and three slug magazines for the Bulldog.
sunrise-ammo-kit-selection-shotgun-assorted-name = 12-gauge ammunition assortment
sunrise-ammo-kit-selection-shotgun-assorted-description = Contains two buckshot drums, two slug drums, one incendiary drum, and one flechette drum.
sunrise-ammo-kit-selection-lmg-description = Contains two SP and one FMJ ammunition box for the L6 SAW.
sunrise-ammo-kit-selection-lmg-max-description = Contains one 100-round SP box and one 100-round FMJ box for the L6 MAX.
sunrise-ammo-kit-selection-grenade-frag-contact-name = contact fragmentation grenade pouch
sunrise-ammo-kit-selection-grenade-frag-contact-description = Contains six contact fragmentation grenades for the China Lake grenade launcher.
sunrise-ammo-kit-selection-grenade-frag-timer-name = timed fragmentation grenade pouch
sunrise-ammo-kit-selection-grenade-frag-timer-description = Contains six timed fragmentation grenades for the China Lake grenade launcher.
